{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01070","headline":"相和歌辞 陌上桑 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞 陌上桑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美女渭桥东，春还事蚕作。\n五马如飞龙，青丝结金络。\n不知谁家子，调笑来相谑。\n妾本秦罗敷，玉颜艳名都。\n绿条映素手，采桑向城隅。\n使君且不顾，况复论秋胡。\n寒螿爱碧草，鸣凤栖青梧。\n托心自有处，但怪傍人愚。\n徒令白日暮，高驾空踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}